WEBVTT

00:09:58.052 --> 00:10:01.805
we have a million excess deaths
from COVID in the United States

00:10:01.847 --> 00:10:05.184
and a political landscape far stranger
than anything we've ever seen.

00:10:05.976 --> 00:10:08.854
The same is going to be true for games.

00:10:09.438 --> 00:10:11.482
First you're a player,

00:10:11.523 --> 00:10:13.317
then you're a fan,

00:10:13.359 --> 00:10:14.943
soon you're in a clan,

00:10:14.985 --> 00:10:17.738
and before you know it,
you're invading the Capitol.

00:10:19.365 --> 00:10:21.492
So I'm a futurist.

00:10:21.867 --> 00:10:23.619
And there's a saying with futurists,

00:10:23.661 --> 00:10:26.163
that your job is not to just
predict the automobile,

00:10:26.205 --> 00:10:27.748
but to predict the traffic jams.

00:10:28.165 --> 00:10:30.626
So what might this look like
in 10 or 20 years,